Subject: [PATCH] Adapt SmartSuggestions patches for China build

Relax CHN Custom Card runtime gates and quota values, keep Samsung Account country headers populated,
redirect undeclared CHN activity names to declared screens, redirect Notification Summary
settings to the declared settings activity, align the evening Now Brief active window,
tune Now Bar ranking for CHN class names, and translate default CHN/Japan resource
labels to English.

